// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// AutoFill.gs  v3  —  Social Eagle Daily Ads Auto-Fill
// Runs at 7:00 AM IST every day via time-based trigger.
// WHY 7 AM: MK DB daily ingest (Windsor + Kylas) runs at 6:00 AM IST.
// Running before 6 AM means the API returns stale/empty CRM data for yesterday.
//
// What happens at 7 AM:
//   1. Pull yesterday's result + optin counts from MK DB API (GHL/Kylas data)
//   2. Read end-of-yesterday row counts from HW + BO result sheets
//   3. Pull yesterday's Windsor spend per campaign
//   4. Compute HW/BO call bookings = endCount − startCount (from prev midnight)
//   5. Aggregate all data by course
//   6. Write yesterday's rows to the monthly tab:
//        Col C = Ads Spent (from Windsor)
//        Col E = Result    (from MK DB API — GHL/Kylas verified counts)
//        Col G = Optin     (from MK DB API)
//      KEY FIX: Always write 0 explicitly — never leave cells blank.
//      This ensures the email trigger sees filled cells and fires correctly.
// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

